---
/** Pull-quote: IBM Plex Sans italic, cobalt, left rule. */
---
<p class="quote"><slot /></p>

<style>
  .quote { margin: .25rem 0 0; max-width: 62ch; padding-left: 1.25rem; border-left: 1px solid var(--rule); font: italic 400 clamp(1.3rem, 2vw, 1.75rem)/1.35 var(--font-body); color: var(--accent); text-wrap: pretty; }
</style>
